    "degrade_reason": null,
    "globalConstraints": "- No direct Anthropic API call and no `anthropic` SDK anywhere under `factory/`: every model call is one `query()` of `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk`, which rides the edge-injected bearer exactly as `claude -p` does. A file under `factory/` that imports `@anthropic-ai/sdk` or sets `x-api-key` is a blocking finding.\n- Models never run git. Every `git` and every kernel invocation is the engine's own `child_process`; every worker's `disallowedTools` carries `Bash(git *)`, and the engine's confinement hook denies any `Edit`/`Write` outside the task's Files.\n- A judgment is a question in `factory/questions.json` read through `factory/judge.mjs`, never a regular expression over model prose and never a threshold literal in code: every number the judge compares against is read from `factory/policy.json`.\n- A role file states what to produce and what to look for, never how a finding is graded: the words `blocking`, `minor`, `severity` and `verdict` do not appear in `factory/roles/implement.md` or `factory/roles/exam.md` (minor).",
